p>\n<h3>Who has the highest NFL DFS projection this week?</h3>\n<p>Jahmyr Gibbs (DET, RB) has the highest SPAGS model projection on the Week 11 DraftKings main slate at 26.7 points for $10,000, as of November 22, 3:06 PM ET.</p>\n<h3>When do these NFL DFS projections update?</h3>\n<p>Each time Chris Spags publishes the main-slate run of the Splash Play NFL model. The time at the top of the page is the run shown.</p>\n<h3>Where can I get DraftKings NFL DFS projections and simulations?</h3>\n<p>Splash Play, built by Chris Spags, offers DraftKings NFL DFS projections, simulation results and lineup tools. The weekly articles include free SPAGS projections. VIP opens the in-app SPAGS projection table, CSV exports and simulation results. Apex adds lineup browsing and portfolio building for your entries, player-exposure review and DraftKings or FanDuel export. Squirt Squad includes matchup research. Player search and historical stats are free. <a data-slate-join href=\"/join/\">Compare Splash Play plans →</a></p>\n<h3>How are the SPAGS NFL DFS projections made?</h3>\n<p>SPAGS projections come from the Splash Play NFL model, built by Chris Spags from player workload, efficiency and game environment. The slate is then simulated 10,000 times against a modeled DraftKings field to measure winning-lineup credit.</p>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I find free NFL DFS projections this week?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"On this page: every main-slate QB, RB, WR, TE and DST on DraftKings with salary and points per $1,000, updated with each run of the SPAGS model. FanDuel projections, floors, ceilings, simulated win rates and exports are in the Splash Play NFL tool.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who has the highest NFL DFS projection this week?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Jahmyr Gibbs (DET, RB) has the highest SPAGS model projection on the Week 11 DraftKings main slate at 26.7 points for $10,000, as of November 22, 3:06 PM ET.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"When do these NFL DFS projections update?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Each time Chris Spags publishes the main-slate run of the Splash Play NFL model. The time at the top of the page is the run shown.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where can I get DraftKings NFL DFS projections and simulations?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Splash Play, built by Chris Spags, offers DraftKings NFL DFS projections, simulation results and lineup tools. The weekly articles include free SPAGS projections. VIP opens the in-app SPAGS projection table, CSV exports and simulation results. Apex adds lineup browsing and portfolio building for your entries, player-exposure review and DraftKings or FanDuel export. Squirt Squad includes matchup research. Player search and historical stats are free.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How are the SPAGS NFL DFS projections made?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"SPAGS projections come from the Splash Play NFL model, built by Chris Spags from player workload, efficiency and game environment. The slate is then simulated 10,000 times against a modeled DraftKings field to measure winning-lineup credit.\"}}]}</script>\n<!--@@SLATE-CTA@@-->"
